  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Largest Floor Plan in Villa Lago! Payton's Place is a beautiful, incredibly comfortable beach retreat. This stylish home has all the comforts, equipment and amenities you and your family will need. Our home is located in Villa Lago, the newest single family neighborhood within the gates of the exclusive Sandestin Golf and Beach Resort. Sandestin boasts more than 7 miles of white sand beach and bayfront property, four championship golf courses, 15 world class tennis courts and 90 lakes that are great for fishing. Villa Lago is a bright, beautiful development surrounded by the Baytowne golf course.<br><br>Our house is two doors from the community pool in Villa Lago and is an easy short walk to the Baytowne Wharf (<.5mile), with family fun, shopping and dining, but go ahead and drive one of the two golf carts instead. The home has 2 golf carts, one 6 passenger cart and one 4 passenger cart. This home has 4 spacious comfortable bedrooms. Each bedroom has its own full bath. Our home sleeps 10 comfortably, all in their own beds. The house has 4 outdoor patios, several with seating. The main patio (back of house) off the kitchen is perfect for morning coffee or afternoon wine - down as the sun sets on the other opposite of the house. Our home is one of the largest four bedrooms in the neighborhood, and the extra space, in the bathrooms, bedrooms and living area, will immediately make you more comfortable.<br><br>The look and feel of this beautifully designed home will immediately put you and your guests in a vacation state of mind. The colors, finishes and furnishings are so relaxing, you may never want to go home! Stay a while....the house has everything you need for a convenient extended family beach and golf escape. Beach chairs, beach towels, a cooler and beach toys, plus a new Cornhole bag game set, footballs, a volleyball and more.<br><br>Inside the home, we have set the house to be as comfortable as possible for everyone. We have provided games, cards, puzzles and five flat screen TVs, with Apple TV on the large TV in the family room, for entertainment during that rare rain storm here in Paradise. There is extra seating at the large master dining table (10) and the large kitchen island (4).<br><br>The kitchen is also top shelf. A great place to cook and enjoy a family meal. New, premium stainless steel appliances, beautiful quartzite countertops, and all the convenience appliances you could ever need, it is also fully stocked with all the utensils you need to prepare those wonderful family meals. There is a new gas grill on the back patio, as well.<br><br>We feel this is the best location in Sandestin, which is the best community on the Emerald Coast for a beach holiday. We have made this a labor of love to create a beautiful home from which you can enjoy your fun and relaxing getaway. We think you will love it as much as we do.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Villa Lago Luxury! Comfort Abounds! Steps to Baytowne Wharf, 2 Golf Carts!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
